Document: fim-documentation
Title: Tutorial & Miscellaneous documentation for Fim
Author: Michele Martone
Abstract: Fim stands for Fbi IMproved. Fbi is a framebuffer based
 image viewer, made by Gerd Knorr, and Fim is primarily an interface
 rework applied roughly as a patch to it, and is its main purpose is
 to boost the features present in Fbi and to add new ones, to achieve
 configurability and use flexibility, as well as usage speed. This
 document provide miscellaneous documentation and a tutorial for Fim.
